---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { legacyResearchProjectReports, paperReports, projectReports, surveyPublicationReports } from '@/data/reports';
---
<BaseLayout title="Self Evolve 报告状态索引 — 可索引证据页与引用边界" description="Self Evolve 报告状态索引：把项目证据页、legacy source wrappers、论文阅读地图和 Survey 发布切片转成可索引 HTML，同时标清不同引用边界。" alternateZh="/reports/" alternateEn="/en/reports/">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="eyebrow">Reports / 研究报告</div>
      <h1 class="gradient-text">这些报告能帮你追溯证据，但不是每一页都能引用。</h1>
      <p class="lead">本页先回答三个读者问题：哪些报告能作为阅读地图，哪些页面只能帮助追溯来源，哪些结论仍在 reader/editor 与 academic review 队列里。</p>
      <div class="metrics">
        <div class="metric"><strong>{projectReports.length}</strong><span>份项目分析报告</span></div>
        <div class="metric"><strong>{legacyResearchProjectReports.length}</strong><span>份 legacy research 报告</span></div>
        <div class="metric"><strong>{surveyPublicationReports.length}</strong><span>份 Survey 发布切片</span></div>
        <div class="metric"><strong>{paperReports.length}</strong><span>份论文报告</span></div>
      </div>
      <aside class="source-panel" aria-label="报告状态阅读边界">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">Reading contract / 阅读契约</div>
          <h2>先看状态，再引用内容</h2>
          <p>报告页分成三种用法：论文地图用于继续阅读论文，项目/legacy/survey 待审页用于追溯来源，QA 审计用于修复队列。可访问不等于已完成公开文案审查。</p>
          <p><strong>English:</strong> Accessible report pages are not automatically quality-certified. Use the English mirror to see what is reader-ready, source-only, or still gated.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="source-links">
          <a href="/en/reports/">English status guide</a>
          <a href="/en/paper/">Paper citation status</a>
          <a href="/search/">搜索证据链</a>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  {paperReports.length > 0 && (
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <div class="eyebrow">Paper reading maps</div>
            <h2>先读论文地图：它们帮助定位来源，不替代系统综述结论</h2>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="lead">论文报告的用途是把跨领域论文、机制和来源连起来。引用具体 claim 前，仍要回到论文原文、当前论文页和限制段。</p>
        <div class="grid">
          {paperReports.map((report) => (
            <article class="card">
              <div class="eyebrow">{report.category} · literature map</div>
              <h3><a href={report.href}>{report.title}</a></h3>
              <p>{report.excerpt}</p>
              <div class="pill-row">
                <span class="pill">paper source trail</span>
                <span class="pill">not peer-reviewed meta-analysis</span>
                <a class="pill" href={report.href}>阅读报告</a>
              </div>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  )}

  {projectReports.length > 0 && (
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <div class="eyebrow">Source-only project evidence</div>
            <h2>项目待审证据页：能追溯来源，暂不引用结论</h2>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="lead">这些页面保留 GitHub 源、站内分类、机制线索和限制提醒。它们进入 sitemap，作为可索引证据入口；逐篇审查完成前，不能把正文 claim 当最终结论引用。</p>
        <div class="grid">
          {projectReports.slice(0, 18).map((report) => (
            <article class="card">
              <div class="eyebrow">{report.category}</div>
              <h3><a href={report.href}>{report.title}</a></h3>
              <p>用这页定位原始来源和未解决证据缺口。公开文案审查通过前，不要把正文当作已审定结论引用。</p>
              <div class="pill-row">
                <span class="pill">可索引入口</span>
                <span class="pill">审查中</span>
                <span class="pill">来源追踪</span>
                <a class="pill" href={report.href}>查看待审证据页</a>
              </div>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
        {projectReports.length > 18 && <p style="margin-top: 18px; color: var(--muted);">显示前 18 份，共 {projectReports.length} 份可索引项目证据页。</p>}
      </div>
    </section>
  )}

  {legacyResearchProjectReports.length > 0 && (
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <div class="eyebrow">Legacy research reports</div>
            <h2>旧 research/project Markdown 的 HTML 索引入口</h2>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="lead">这些文件来自早期 research/project 报告，现在都有 canonical HTML 包装页并进入 sitemap。它们解决发现与追溯问题；读者引用前仍必须回到当前项目卡、原始 GitHub 仓库和限制段复核。</p>
        <div class="grid">
          {legacyResearchProjectReports.slice(0, 12).map((report) => (
            <article class="card">
              <div class="eyebrow">{report.category}</div>
              <h3><a href={report.href}>{report.title}</a></h3>
              <p>旧报告的待审 HTML 包装页。它只适合追溯来源；不要把旧正文当作当前已审定结论引用。</p>
              <div class="pill-row">
                <span class="pill">可索引包装页</span>
                <span class="pill">旧来源</span>
                <a class="pill" href={report.href}>查看待审旧报告</a>
              </div>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
        {legacyResearchProjectReports.length > 12 && <p style="margin-top: 18px; color: var(--muted);">显示前 12 份，共 {legacyResearchProjectReports.length} 份可索引 legacy research 报告。</p>}
      </div>
    </section>
  )}

  {surveyPublicationReports.length > 0 && (
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <div class="eyebrow">Survey publication</div>
            <h2>面向公开发布的 Survey 切片</h2>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="lead">这些切片是英文发布候选，已作为可索引文章资产开放；它们尚未补齐中文同证据链与学术审查，不能代表完整双语最终发布。</p>
        <div class="grid">
          {surveyPublicationReports.map((report) => (
            <article class="card">
              <div class="eyebrow">{report.category}</div>
              <h3><a href={report.href}>{report.title}</a></h3>
              <p>待审发布切片。双语同证据链和学术审查通过前，只能当作草稿级证据压缩来读。</p>
              <div class="pill-row">
                <span class="pill">可索引</span>
                <span class="pill">双语待补齐</span>
                <span class="pill">学术审查中</span>
                <a class="pill" href={report.href}>阅读待审切片</a>
              </div>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  )}

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">QA Audit</div>
          <h2>质量审查报告</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid">
        <article class="card" style="border-left: 4px solid #B83224;">
          <div class="eyebrow">QA · EN→CN Mapping</div>
          <h3><a href="/reports/en-cn-mapping-audit">EN→CN Full Mapping Audit</a></h3>
          <p>质量修复队列：英文论文与中文 survey/latex 结构仍有章节映射偏离。该审计页保持 noindex，不作为面向外部读者的知识型文章。</p>
          <div class="pill-row">
            <span class="pill">audit</span>
            <span class="pill" style="background: #B83224; color: white;">2 CRITICAL</span>
            <a class="pill" href="/reports/en-cn-mapping-audit">查看审查</a>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="card" style="border-left: 4px solid #B83224;">
          <div class="eyebrow">QA · Live publication</div>
          <h3><a href="/reports/live-publication-readiness/">Live Publication Readiness Audit</a></h3>
          <p>区分本地 SEO metadata 通过和 Google 严格 HTTPS 抓取可用：当前重点检查 GitHub Pages HTTPS enforcement、证书 SAN、首页与 sitemap。</p>
          <div class="pill-row">
            <span class="pill">external crawl gate</span>
            <span class="pill" style="background: #B83224; color: white;">HTTPS BLOCKER</span>
            <a class="pill" href="/reports/live-publication-readiness/">查看发布状态</a>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="card" style="border-left: 4px solid #2F6F4E;">
          <div class="eyebrow">QA · GitHub topic</div>
          <h3><a href="/reports/github-topic-indexing-readiness/">GitHub Topic Indexing Readiness</a></h3>
          <p>回答 `agent-evolution` topic 是否收录：检查远端 topics、仓库 description/homepage、GitHub Search 和 topic 页面渲染，避免把网页缓存误判成 metadata 缺失。</p>
          <div class="pill-row">
            <span class="pill">GitHub discovery</span>
            <span class="pill" style="background: #2F6F4E; color: white;">TOPIC PASS</span>
            <a class="pill" href="/reports/github-topic-indexing-readiness/">查看 Topic 状态</a>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="card" style="border-left: 4px solid #B8860B;">
          <div class="eyebrow">QA · Text assets</div>
          <h3><a href="/reports/text-asset-indexability/">Text Asset Indexability Audit</a></h3>
          <p>回答“所有文字是否都已变成可索引资产”：区分 public HTML、GitHub README、processed-but-unrouted、raw-do-not-publish 和 external mirrors。</p>
          <div class="pill-row">
            <span class="pill">coverage gate</span>
            <span class="pill" style="background: #B8860B; color: white;">INCOMPLETE</span>
            <a class="pill" href="/reports/text-asset-indexability/">查看文字资产覆盖</a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
